[
  {
    "comment": "【认证方式】Cookie 登录态，不需要账号密码。使用登录 10001.baidubaidu.win 后的完整 Cookie 与同一浏览器 User-Agent，两项必须成对；推荐在已登录浏览器中用「QianDao Cookie Extractor」一键读取，手动复制时保留 Cookie 原文，不要解码或裁剪。\n\n【本模板做什么】处理高清影视之家固定每日奖励流程：\n1. 打开首页确认本人登录并提取 UID；\n2. 读取积分规则中的“每天登录”记录，判断今天是否已推进；\n3. 只有今天尚未推进时，才检查已完成任务并申请固定红包任务 id=12；\n4. 不自动重试、不发帖、不操作其他任务。\n\n【成功判定】必须确认同一 account_uid 的每日登录记录，且日志中至少出现“今日登录已确认”、任务申请成功或本期已申请等可验证状态；所有状态缺失时失败关闭。\n\n【失效处理】站点返回登录页、明确提示登录失效、验证码或安全验证，以及页面结构不再符合预期时，任务会失败关闭，不会伪造成功。重新登录 10001.baidubaidu.win 后成对获取 Cookie 与 User-Agent 即可，模板本身不需要修改。\n\n【补充说明】页面出现安全验证、人机验证、滑块或返回登录页时直接失败，不会推断红包已经领取。",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://10001.baidubaidu.win/",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Cookie",
          "value": "{{cookie}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "User-Agent",
          "value": "{{user_agent}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept-Language",
          "value": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9"
        },
        {
          "name": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "no-cache"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "/(?=[\\s\\S]*action=logout)(?=[\\s\\S]*discuz_uid\\s*=\\s*[\"'][1-9]\\d*[\"'])/i",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "安全验证|人机验证|请完成[^\\n]{0,20}验证|拖动[^\\n]{0,20}滑块|验证码",
          "from": "content"
        },
        {
          "re": "请在登[陆录]账号后继续访问网站|用户登录页面|请先登录|member\\.php\\?mod=logging(?:&amp;|&)action=login",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "extract_variables": [
        {
          "name": "account_uid",
          "re": "discuz_uid\\s*=\\s*[\"']([1-9]\\d*)[\"']",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "读取当前账号的积分规则记录，只接受唯一“每天登录”行及其可验证时间；今日已记录时不进入任务中心",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://10001.baidubaidu.win/home.php?mod=spacecp&ac=credit&op=log&suboperation=creditrulelog",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Cookie",
          "value": "{{cookie}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "User-Agent",
          "value": "{{user_agent}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept-Language",
          "value": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9"
        },
        {
          "name": "Referer",
          "value": "https://10001.baidubaidu.win/"
        },
        {
          "name": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "no-cache"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "/(?=[\\s\\S]*action=logout)(?=[\\s\\S]*discuz_uid\\s*=\\s*[\"']{{account_uid}}[\"'])(?=[\\s\\S]*<tr[^>]*>(?:(?!<\\/tr>)[\\s\\S])*每天登录(?:(?!<\\/tr>)[\\s\\S])*\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}\\s+\\d{2}:\\d{2})/i",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "安全验证|人机验证|请完成[^\\n]{0,20}验证|拖动[^\\n]{0,20}滑块|验证码",
          "from": "content"
        },
        {
          "re": "请在登[陆录]账号后继续访问网站|用户登录页面|请先登录|member\\.php\\?mod=logging(?:&amp;|&)action=login",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "extract_variables": [
        {
          "name": "reward_date",
          "re": "/(?=[\\s\\S]*每天登录)[\\s\\S]*?(\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2})/i",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "把奖励日期中与当前上海日期相同的值替换为内部标记 today_ok；只用于决定是否需要红包兜底",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "api://util/string/replace?r=text&t=today_ok&p={{1|date_time(1,0)}}&s={{reward_date|urlencode}}",
      "headers": [],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": ".+",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [],
      "extract_variables": [
        {
          "name": "reward_state",
          "re": "(.*)",
          "from": "content"
        },
        {
          "name": "reward_today",
          "re": "(today_ok)",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "把仍为非 today_ok 的奖励日期替换为内部标记 pending；页面缺失日期时不会进入红包分支",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "api://util/string/replace?r=text&t=pending&p=%5E%28%3F%21today_ok%24%29.*%24&s={{reward_state|urlencode}}",
      "headers": [],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": ".+",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [],
      "extract_variables": [
        {
          "name": "needs_redpacket",
          "re": "(pending)",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "仅在“每天登录”奖励今天尚未推进时进入固定红包任务分支",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "{% if needs_redpacket == \"pending\" %}",
      "headers": [],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [],
      "failed_asserts": [],
      "extract_variables": []
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "读取当前账号的已完成任务页，确认每日红包是否已经领取；已领取时不再申请",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://10001.baidubaidu.win/home.php?mod=task&item=done",
